{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-majestic-vistas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"majestic-vistas-by-emaar","about":"Dreaming of a residential destination that appeals to all your senses? Majestic Vistas by Emaar is the ultimate paradise in the Middle East where luxurious living meets every facet of your sense of well-being. Here is where you can SEE picturesque views of landscapes and fairways, TASTE the beauty of life through get-togethers in a signature ambiance, SMELL nature’s fresh air from sun up to sun down, HEAR the sound of happiness brought by a golf lifestyle, and TOUCH the supreme comfort of your cozy six-bedroom villa.Green Landscapes and a Golf Lifestyle Await YouWake up to the awe-inspiring views of the 18-hole golf course set against the backdrop if the iconic Burj Khalifa and the vibrant Downtown Dubai. What’s more, with the 1, 730, 700 sqm of verdant open spaces at Dubai Hills Estate’s most special destination, the revitalizing scent of nature await you in every corner making it a place you can call home in the heart of the metropolis.Enticing 6-Bedroom VillasEnveloped by green landscapes, Majestic Vistas at Dubai Hills feature a collection of alluring six-bedroom villas where there is ample natural light, a perfect balance of impressive proportions, and a an accent of contemporary interior design. A nurturing abode for the family, this is the impeccable place to make memories and celebrate the beauty of life.Exclusive Amenities You Won’t Enough OfApart from the Arabesque villa living, Majestic Vistas villas in Dubai offer a myriad of reasons for everyday celebrations. Take delight in your own private garden; two kitchens; formal and family living areas; children’s playground; meticulously constructed lawn and walking trails; world-class retail, dining, and entertainment facilities for the whole family, and many more.","price":null,"title":"Majestic Vistas","bitrix":{"id":225,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Majestic Vistas","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Majestic Vistas","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Dubai Hills Estate"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/majestic_feature_1a2403a5fa.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/majestic_feature_1a2403a5fa.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.12261515,"lng":55.2751200855707},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/majestic_5_d8ae71f476.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/majestic_5_d8ae71f476.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/majestic_1_92213587b6.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/majestic_1_92213587b6.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/majestic_2_e395f2a694.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/majestic_2_e395f2a694.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/majestic_feature_1a2403a5fa.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/majestic_feature_1a2403a5fa.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/majestic_5_d8ae71f476.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/majestic_5_d8ae71f476.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/majestic_1_92213587b6.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/majestic_1_92213587b6.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/majestic_2_e395f2a694.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/majestic_2_e395f2a694.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/majestic_3_bcd210c70b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/majestic_3_bcd210c70b.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpj